        <mxCell id="note" value="To-Be model. Blue = done automatically by the loan system · orange = done by a person, changed from the As-Is · diamonds and events as in the As-Is model. Branch staff can complete N1 with a walk-in customer on a tablet (assisted mode), so the Branch lane is no longer needed on the main path.&lt;br&gt;Every change links to an improvement in improvement_options.xlsx (I1–I6). Controls kept: KYC (N4), consent (N1), screening (N5), KFS before signing (N9), final compliance check (A24), disbursal only to the borrower's own account (A25)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#55636B;" parent="1" vertex="1">
